<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P raises China development bank forex rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P raises China development bank forex rating.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Wednesday it had raised its long-term foreign currency rating for the State Development Bank of China (SDBC) to BBB+ from BBB.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also said it had revised the outlook for the bank's foreign currency rating to stable from positive.</p>
</text>
